4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7AKrraTHTpoQ7kNvwFbejIU&_nc_oc=AdrsrtUIXvuVX5bUyXmi85ml13dMytJ2NgzJVczE8ojj8tFkKhUB3WJOb77z71mFLGQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAjl8J1_M8UBGNGWv6W6rm4N88HvrNVUkkqPvDwwb02Yg&oe=6A5CCB54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o2olnCn6E_MQ7kNvwGLaLRM&_nc_oc=Adrm_00lzFjTvUSvIrf6DkxnBAt8mqV7ym2m3uAe9C0k8nSCCOoebMmVWvKjXspRjvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCRAa7SlxLAk35D67Au577etitR7QAuZFoxH8zkPsYdlw&oe=6A5CD032"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qUZN7b96o-0Q7kNvwEuja0A&_nc_oc=Ado4TIv4ViDb14qQfAa-Z6q29-w-l4swwshTALU7J4NqKDg9yCMZESdp1RSfda3-clo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDvUyif3t0sduy62vfqmhAI6KnUKkBRzuKCY7jJ6ldUIg&oe=6A5CDDD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p